{
  "name": "Module 4 - Google Sheets Logger",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "start-module-4",
      "name": "Start from Module 3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 400],
      "notes": "📥 INPUT FROM MODULE 3\n\nReceives:\n- filteredJobs: Array of filtered, deduplicated jobs\n- jobCount: Number of new jobs\n- runId: Execution ID\n- status: 'Filtered'\n\nThis is the entry point from Module 3."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID_HERE",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Jobs",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "jobId": "={{ $json.jobId }}",
            "dateScraped": "={{ $json.dateScraped }}",
            "sourcePlatform": "={{ $json.sourcePlatform }}",
            "jobTitle": "={{ $json.jobTitle }}",
            "companyName": "={{ $json.companyName }}",
            "companySize": "={{ $json.companySize }}",
            "location": "={{ $json.location }}",
            "workMode": "={{ $json.workMode }}",
            "experienceLevel": "={{ $json.experienceLevel }}",
            "salaryRange": "={{ $json.salaryRange }}",
            "jobDescription": "={{ $json.jobDescription }}",
            "keySkills": "={{ $json.keySkills }}",
            "jobUrl": "={{ $json.jobUrl }}",
            "postedDate": "={{ $json.postedDate }}",
            "applicationDeadline": "={{ $json.applicationDeadline }}",
            "matchScore": "={{ $json.matchScore }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.status }}",
            "resumeLink": "={{ $json.resumeLink }}",
            "notes": "={{ $json.notes }}",
            "lastUpdated": "={{ $json.lastUpdated }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "useAppend": true
        }
      },
      "id": "write-jobs-to-sheet",
      "name": "Write Jobs to Sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [460, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets - Job Hunt"
        }
      },
      "notes": "📊 WRITE TO GOOGLE SHEETS - JOBS TAB\n\n⚠️ SETUP REQUIRED:\n\n1. Configure Google Sheets credential\n2. Set Document ID: YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID_HERE\n3. Set Sheet Name: 'Jobs'\n4. Operation: 'Append or Update Row'\n5. Verify all 20 columns are mapped\n\nPURPOSE: Write filtered jobs to Jobs tab\n\nMAPPING: All 20 columns from schema:\n- A: jobId\n- B: dateScraped\n- C: sourcePlatform\n- D: jobTitle\n- E: companyName\n- F: companySize\n- G: location\n- H: workMode\n- I: experienceLevel\n- J: salaryRange\n- K: jobDescription\n- L: keySkills\n- M: jobUrl\n- N: postedDate\n- O: applicationDeadline\n- P: matchScore\n- Q: status\n- R: resumeLink\n- S: notes\n- T: lastUpdated\n\nOPTION: useAppend = true\n- Adds new rows at bottom\n- Faster than update mode\n\nTEST:\n- Execute node\n- Check Google Sheet → Jobs tab\n- Should see new rows added"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Count jobs written\nconst jobsWritten = $input.all().length;\nconst runId = $('Start from Module 3').first().json.runId;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    jobsWritten: jobsWritten,\n    runId: runId,\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString().replace('T', ' ').substring(0, 19),\n    status: 'Success',\n    message: `Successfully wrote ${jobsWritten} jobs to Google Sheets`\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "count-jobs-written",
      "name": "Count Jobs Written",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [680, 400],
      "notes": "📊 COUNT & LOG\n\nPURPOSE: Count how many jobs were written\n\nOUTPUT:\n- jobsWritten: Number count\n- runId: Execution ID\n- timestamp: Current time\n- status: Success\n\nThis data flows to:\n1. Logs tab (for record keeping)\n2. Module 5 (Resume Tailor)\n\nWHAT TO SET:\n✅ Nothing! Auto-counts."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "log-id",
              "name": "logId",
              "value": "={{ $json.runId }}-jobs-logged",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "log-timestamp",
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{ $json.timestamp }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "log-runid",
              "name": "workflowRunId",
              "value": "={{ $json.runId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "log-module",
              "name": "module",
              "value": "Module 4 - Google Sheets Logger",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "log-action",
              "name": "action",
              "value": "Write Jobs to Sheet",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "log-status",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "log-records",
              "name": "recordsProcessed",
              "value": "={{ $json.jobsWritten }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "log-error",
              "name": "errorMessage",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "log-retry",
              "name": "retryCount",
              "value": "=0",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "log-notes",
              "name": "notes",
              "value": "={{ $json.message }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "format-log-entry",
      "name": "Format Log Entry",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.3,
      "position": [900, 400],
      "notes": "📝 FORMAT LOG\n\nPURPOSE: Format execution log for Logs tab\n\nMaps to Logs schema (10 columns):\n- logId\n- timestamp\n- workflowRunId\n- module\n- action\n- status\n- recordsProcessed\n- errorMessage\n- retryCount\n- notes\n\nWHAT TO SET:\n✅ Nothing! Auto-formats."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID_HERE",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Logs",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "logId": "={{ $json.logId }}",
            "timestamp": "={{ $json.timestamp }}",
            "workflowRunId": "={{ $json.workflowRunId }}",
            "module": "={{ $json.module }}",
            "action": "={{ $json.action }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.status }}",
            "recordsProcessed": "={{ $json.recordsProcessed }}",
            "errorMessage": "={{ $json.errorMessage }}",
            "retryCount": "={{ $json.retryCount }}",
            "notes": "={{ $json.notes }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "write-to-logs",
      "name": "Write to Logs Tab",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1120, 400],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "YOUR_GOOGLE_CREDENTIALS_ID",
          "name": "Google Sheets - Job Hunt"
        }
      },
      "notes": "📊 WRITE TO LOGS TAB\n\n⚠️ SETUP REQUIRED:\n\n1. Use same Google Sheets credential\n2. Same Sheet ID\n3. Sheet Name: 'Logs'\n4. Operation: 'Append'\n\nPURPOSE: Log this module's execution\n\nLOGS:\n- How many jobs were written\n- Execution timestamp\n- Success status\n\nWHAT TO SET:\n✅ Same as Jobs tab - just change sheet name to 'Logs'"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "output-runid",
