              "value": "Jobs successfully logged to Google Sheets. Ready for Module 5 (Resume Tailor).",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "output-to-module-5",
      "name": "Output to Module 5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.3,
      "position": [1340, 400],
      "notes": "🚀 OUTPUT TO MODULE 5\n\nPURPOSE: Prepare data for Resume Tailor module\n\nOUTPUT:\n- runId: To track which jobs belong to this run\n- jobsLogged: Count for reference\n- status: 'Logged'\n\nNEXT MODULE: Module 5 - Resume Tailor\n- Will read jobs with status='Discovered'\n- Generate tailored resumes for each\n\nWHAT TO SET:\n✅ Nothing! Auto-prepares output."
    }
  ],
